{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"uncensored local model security boundary uncensored local model security boundary","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md","fileName":"Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Local LLM Network Engineering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"uncensored local model security boundary uncensored local model security boundary","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md","fileName":"Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary","heading":"Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"An uncensored local model removes provider-side content restrictions and can generate code for sensitive network assessment or configuration tasks. That freedom may support authorized security work, but it also removes a layer that might otherwise refuse harmful or high-risk requests.\n\nThe deployment therefore needs a stronger external boundary: restricted users, isolated execution, limited tools, protected network data, logging, and mandatory review. “Uncensored” describes model behavior, not permission. Authorization still comes from the organization, and generated commands must remain outside production until independently validated.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"uncensored local model security boundary uncensored local model security boundary","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md","fileName":"Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Uncensored Local Model Security Boundary","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Local LLM Network Engineering","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}